        },
        "DNA Lockdown (BT16-025)": {
          "tests": [
            "dna_lockdown_suspends_and_locks_opponent",
            "regular_digivolve_into_meta_paildramon_suspends_but_does_not_lock"
          ],
          "passed": true,
          "asserts": "DNA path suspends opp AND applies CannotUnsuspend; regular digivolve suspends but does not lock."
        },
        "Colour Source Replay (ST9-06)": {
          "tests": [
            "colour_source_replay_with_blue_and_green_sources_replays_both",
            "colour_source_replay_without_green_source_replays_only_blue"
          ],
          "passed": true,
          "asserts": "Blue+green Lv.4 sources both replay (field +2); blue-only stack replays only blue (field +1); prompt describes the colour."
        },
        "Evolution-cost & colour gate": {
          "tests": [
            "paildramon_st9_05_dna_alt_path_requires_blue_lv4_and_green_lv4_at_cost_0",
            "imperialdramon_dm_st9_06_standard_digivolve_is_blue_lv5_cost_4"
          ],
          "passed": true,
          "asserts": "Paildramon DNA = Blue Lv.4 + Green Lv.4 @ cost 0; standard digivolve cost 4; IDramon DM standard = Blue Lv.5 @ cost 4."
        },
        "Digivolution colour gate (ExVeemon/Stingmon/Wormmon)": {
          "tests": [
            "veemon_digivolves_over_blue_egg",
            "wormmon_cannot_digivolve_over_blue_egg",
            "wormmon_digivolves_over_green_egg",
            "single_colour_exveemon_takes_blue_lv3_not_green",
            "single_colour_stingmon_takes_green_lv3_not_blue",
            "dual_colour_exveemon_and_stingmon_accept_the_off_colour_lv3"
          ],
          "passed": true,
          "asserts": "Standard-digivolve colour+level gate: Wormmon (Green) CANNOT digivolve over a blue egg but CAN over a green egg; single-colour ExVeemon/Stingmon colour-locked; dual-colour BT12-022/BT12-050 accept either colour Lv.3."
        }
      },
      "interaction_tests_total": 14,
      "interaction_tests_passed": 14,
      "notes": "Clean pass: 8/8 interaction tests green, no engine bugs found in the tested combos. coverage_gate fails (33/84=39%) only because the full BG Imperial pool spans many un-migrated alternate printings (AD1-011/024, EX1-019, BT12-030/055, BT16-017/018, etc.); combo_presence passes (every piece of the 4 tested combos is implemented), so the gate-fail does not block these interaction tests. Run date 2026-06-02. [Update 2 of 2026-06-02] Added Combo 6 (digivolution colour gate, 6 tests) answering \"can Wormmon digivolve over a blue egg?\" = NO (Green evo cost vs blue-only egg). HARNESS NOTE: the embedded DSL pack carries no printed evo_costs (card_data_from_compiled sets evo_costs empty), so digivolve-colour tests use synthetic cards encoding the real printed evo-costs via can_digivolve; this is a test-fixture limitation, not an engine bug. 14/14 interaction tests green."
